\pard\fi-240\li480\sb40\sa40\bullet\tab {\b "Zero-Access Architecture"} means a system design under which ServaLabs has no technical ability to access Customer data.\par
\pard\fi-240\li480\sb40\sa40\bullet\tab {\b "Order"} means the invoice, quotation, or purchase document governing commercial terms (where applicable; the Free tier requires no Order).\par
\pard\fi-240\li480\sb40\sa40\bullet\tab {\b "Reseller Sale"} means a supply in which ServaLabs sells a Product or Software licence to an authorized ServaLabs reseller, which then resells it onward. In a Reseller Sale there is no Order between ServaLabs and the Customer; the Order is between the Customer and the reseller.\par
\pard\fi-240\li480\sb40\sa40\bullet\tab {\b "Delivery"} means, for a direct sale, delivery to the Customer; and for a Reseller Sale, {\b delivery to the reseller}. Where a period in this Agreement runs "from Delivery", it runs from that date and is not restarted by the onward sale.\par
