\pard\fi-240\li480\sb40\sa40\bullet\tab {\b Export Compliance (Software):} The Software may be obtained and used worldwide, but the Customer will not download, use, resell, sublicense, or transfer it in violation of any applicable export-control, encryption, or economic-sanctions law, and will not make it available to any sanctioned or restricted party or to any comprehensively embargoed country or territory;\par
