\pard\sb140\sa60\b 24.3 Termination by ServaLabs\b0\par
\pard\sb60\sa60 ServaLabs may terminate this Agreement (including the licence granted in Section 15.2) with immediate effect by written notice if the Customer materially breaches this Agreement and, where the breach is curable, fails to cure within fifteen (15) days of notice.\par
\pard\sb60\sa60 {\b Non-curable breaches.} A breach of Section 1 (Purpose), Section 6.5 (Export & Sanctions), Section 13 (Prohibited Uses), or Section 19.1 (Lawful Use Only) is treated as {\b not curable}, and ServaLabs may terminate immediately without a cure period. This is consistent with Section 6.5, which entitles ServaLabs to terminate immediately for an export or sanctions violation.\par
